        "NSCameraUsageDescription": "$(PRODUCT_NAME) uses your camera to take a profile picture, record video proof of your playing level (for example, filming yourself during a rally to verify your skill rating), and scan invite QR codes to join groups, communities, or matches.",
        "NSPhotoLibraryUsageDescription": "$(PRODUCT_NAME) uses your photo library to set a player, group, or community profile picture and to submit rating proof, for example selecting a video of your gameplay to verify your skill level.",
        "NSContactsUsageDescription": "$(PRODUCT_NAME) uses your contacts to import them into shared lists, send SMS invitations, and select match opponents, for example inviting a friend to play via text message.",
        "NSLocationWhenInUseUsageDescription": "$(PRODUCT_NAME) uses your location to show nearby courts and facilities sorted by distance, for example \"Tennis Club 0.3 km away\".",
        "NSLocationAlwaysUsageDescription": "$(PRODUCT_NAME) uses your location to show nearby courts and facilities sorted by distance, for example \"Tennis Club 0.3 km away\".",
        "NSLocationAlwaysAndWhenInUseUsageDescription": "$(PRODUCT_NAME) uses your location to show nearby courts and facilities sorted by distance, for example \"Tennis Club 0.3 km away\".",
        "NSMicrophoneUsageDescription": "$(PRODUCT_NAME) uses your microphone to capture audio when recording video proof of your playing level, for example recording the sound during a rally video.",
        "NSUserTrackingUsageDescription": "Allow tracking so $(PRODUCT_NAME) can measure which ads bring real players and personalize match suggestions. Your data is never sold.",
